cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Mirofy
message: If you use this in published work, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: Hasan-Laraib
repository-code: https://github.com/Hasan-Laraib/Mirofy
url: https://hasan-laraib.github.io/Mirofy/
abstract: >-
  A tool that turns a repository, or a written description, into a validated
  diagram rendered as one self-contained HTML file. Every relationship it
  derives from source carries the file, line range and commit it came from, and
  anything the scanner could not read is recorded as a gap rather than omitted
  silently.
keywords:
  - software architecture
  - diagram generation
  - static analysis
  - provenance
  - documentation
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-01"
